============================================================================
 LEGEND
============================================================================
  K1+K2  : fp16 [B,C,L] NCW → fp32 [B*L,C,1,1] channels-last
           (tiled shared-memory transpose + dtype cast, single CUDA kernel)
  K7+K8  : fp32 [B*L,C,1,1] CL → fp16 [B,C,L] NCW
           (tiled shared-memory transpose + dtype cast, single CUDA kernel)
  K4     : CUTLASS INT8/INT4 GEMM + dequantize (no layout overhead)

  INT8 no-MoDiff : K1+K2 → K3(scale+quant) → K4(GEMM) → K5(scale) → K7+K8
  INT8 w/MoDiff  : K1+K2+K3(fused delta,update_ahat) → K4(GEMM+acc) → K7+K8
  INT4 no-MoDiff : K1+K2 → K3(scale+quant+pack) → K4(GEMM) → K5 → K7+K8
  INT4 w/MoDiff  : K1+K2 → K3(delta+pack,update_ahat) → K4(GEMM+acc) → K7+K8

  MoDiff temporal delta caching: instead of quantizing the full activation,
  quantize only the temporal difference (input_t - a_hat_{t+1}) and accumulate
  into o_hat cache. Reduces quantization error for temporally coherent inputs.
  Reference: Gao et al. 'MoDiff' ICML 2025.

